# W4f, a (k5): takes the gate at @100 with nothing running: its new instance (Public, its remembered default) is still starting
# when b arrives. It plays alone (b never arrives in its stage group).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a in stag0101
wander -150 -60 20 until frames>=1800 fail present>=2
log a alone
idle until frames>=60
